abstract: >-
  StabilityEval checks whether an autonomous software-engineering agent behaves the same way when
  the same issue is described in different words. It applies meaning-preserving transformations
  to SWE-bench Lite issues, runs the agent on the original and on every variant, and reports
  whether the outcome and the patch change. It ships a Streamlit GUI, a CLI and a replay mode that
  reproduces the ICSE 2027 pilot without an API key.
